code/ch06/optimized_ilp_low_occupancy_vec4_impl.cuh:191
Host verification uses a 4-wide coefficient pattern against the kernel's 8-wide pattern, so the demo always reports Incorrect and exits 1
MEDIUM
CUDA kernels (ch06–ch12)
verified by independent skeptic
PROBLEM

